  "label": "PF Backlog 525",
  "title": "P12a: provider rate budgeting - pace within provider_limits WITHOUT blocking agents",
  "body": "## Problem / why\n`config/capacity.json:provider_limits` was data-only; pacing was a single global min-interval, so parallel agents could burst past a provider's limit -> 429s/bans.\n\n## Goal & value\nPace each provider within its declared limits but FAIL-OPEN: never block/abort an agent or stop artifact production (bounded wait; proceed on error).\n",
  "source": "design-review",
  "status": "new",
  "priority": null,
  "moscow": "Should",
